5. construct transactions,
6. simulate every transaction,
7. present an exact human-readable execution plan,
8. require explicit human approval,
9. execute only approved transactions through a dedicated Safe smart account,
10. verify the resulting balances onchain.

The human should never have to manually calculate routes, token quantities, gas requirements, liquidity, approvals, or transaction calldata.

The human should only be asked to perform actions that genuinely require human custody or consent.

